{
  "_help": [
    "The mod ignores anything starting with _ (like this).",
    "Each feature has:",
    "  disabled        true = greyed out in the menu with a DISABLED tag. The feature does not run.",
    "  disabled_reason text shown when hovering DISABLED. Empty = 'This feature is currently under maintenance.'",
    "  killed          true = removed from the menu completely. The feature does not run. Beats disabled.",
    "  tooltip         text for the little 'i' next to the feature's name. Empty = no 'i'.",
    "  versions        extra rules for specific mod versions, e.g.",
    "                  \"1.0.2\" exact | \"<1.0.4\" below | \">=1.0.2 <1.0.5\" range | \"1.0.2, 1.0.3\" either",
    "For disabled/killed the top-level settings apply to EVERY version and ALWAYS win: versions can",
    "only add a disable/kill, never turn one back on.",
    "For tooltip it's the other way round: a version's tooltip REPLACES the top-level one on that version.",
    "mod_only_sounds, slot_locking and keybinds only support tooltip (they have no kill switch).",
    "super_jump's tooltip is the 'i' next to Super Jump inside the Keybinds card.",
    "A feature that is missing here works normally with its built-in tooltip."
  ],

